desc:GJS - X - Sequencer Display (compatibility stub - integrated in SysEx Bridge)
options:gmem=GJS_X_BRIDGE

// Realtime Launchpad rendering moved into "gjs - x - sysex bridge.jsfx".
// Keep this no-op JSFX so existing ReaBox/default projects that still contain
// the old FX do not report a missing effect. It intentionally sends NO MIDI
// and NO SysEx; the SysEx Bridge is now the single hardware display writer.

@init
// compatibility no-op

@block
// intentionally empty
